{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:16a0b5fabbaf4030","name":"Backgrounds","source":{"id":"source:reference-16a0b5fabbaf4030","title":"Backgrounds","revision":16107,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:18Z","sha256":"9cfe1da6fdc52b26a786ffb00093fa80109e4fd981376d505ad4fed2cf550b3d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16107","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Backgrounds&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-16a0b5fabbaf4030","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Every hero has to come from somewhere. Heroes don't all begin as Rebel agents, adventuring smugglers, or daring explorers. For most players, a simple history for their heroes will suffice, but other players might want to choose details in their characters' pasts that will help shape their futures. After all, the heroes are more than just members of a particular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," or the sum of their training; they have defining elements in their histories that molded them into what they will become.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Background system presented here is an alternative to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," system described in the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},". The Background system allows you to focus on a hero's origins rather than on an uncertain future. Gamemasters can use either the Background system or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," system, giving players a choice of selecting a Background or selecting a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"},". It is not recommended to use both systems together because adding another layer to the characters will affect hero complexity and party balance.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["To use the Background system, each player chooses a single Background from the Event category, the Occupation category, or the Planet of Origin category. Each category has its own rules giving special access to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Languages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Languages","referenceId":"reference:318655cea4bd2096"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", or other traits that help define who the character is and what shaped them into a hero. A character receives the benefits of the chosen Background at 1st level, and those benefits stay with the character for life. For details on the benefits gained from each Background, see their individual description.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Background or Destiny?"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Should a Gamemaster use the Background system or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," system in a campaign?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," system puts more powerful abilities in the hands of the heroes, allowing them to perform incredible feats and save themselves from certain death by expending ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},". However, some campaigns, particularly those set during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebellion Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebellion_Era"},", have a more realistic feel. In an era particularly devoid of Jedi, giving such abilities to the heroes might alter the campaign's tone in a way that the Gamemaster wishes to avoid.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Background system is a substitute that tones down the power level of the heroes while providing opportunities for telling interesting stories. The Background system gives each character a special hook that the Gamemaster can use to develop adventures, much in the same way that a hero's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," provides direction for that character. If you are a Gamemaster looking to run a campaign without the high-powered abilities given by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},", consider using the Background system instead.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Backgrounds"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Events"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you choose an Event Background, you decide that your hero has a single, defining Event in their past that put them on the path to becoming a hero. This Event fundamentally shaped your character's life. It was the moment at which they took their first steps toward becoming something more than ordinary, and it continues to shape the way your hero's adventuring career develops.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you select an Event Background, add one of the relevant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," listed at the end of that entry to your character's list of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class_Skills","referenceId":"reference:eab4e467351b3882"},", regardless of starting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},". This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," represents something your character learned to do as a result of the Event. Additionally, when you select an event background, your character gains a small enhancement.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EVENT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RELEVANT SKILLS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ENHANCEMENT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Bankrupt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bankrupt","referenceId":"reference:116532cd6f61d0e2"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," skill to sustain yourself in urban or civilized environments.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Conspiracy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conspiracy","referenceId":"reference:6e911eba808afe83"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You can reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Deception"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Influence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Influence"},", keeping the better result.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Crippled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crippled","referenceId":"reference:c1b611bf9b1b790f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," is reduced as a result of moving down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," remains the same, as if you had no debilitating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conditions","referenceId":"reference:97d4be8960698f97"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Disgraced"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disgraced","referenceId":"reference:5107649006e822db"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You treat any attempt to create a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Appearance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance"}," for yourself as one step simpler.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Enslaved"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Enslaved","referenceId":"reference:a193f10fbdd780e6"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You gain a +2 competence bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," checks.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Exiled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exiled","referenceId":"reference:725d92a1895b7b11"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You can plot a safe course for hyperspace travel in half the time it normally takes (you can plot a course in 30 seconds, or 5 rounds). You gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Knowledge (Galactic Lore))"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore))"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Imprisoned"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imprisoned","referenceId":"reference:2728c08aa37631ca"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You can obtain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Market"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Market"}," goods in half the time it usually takes to obtain (minimum 1 day).\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Marooned"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Marooned","referenceId":"reference:b4e9ac9363ebd465"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You take no penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," checks made to administer ",{"tag":"a","children":["First Aid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/First_Aid"}," to yourself (or to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," yourself, if you are a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},").\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Orphaned"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Orphaned","referenceId":"reference:8d8278071d8e9645"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to add to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," in an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"}," skill, add an extra +1d6 to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scarred"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scarred","referenceId":"reference:7b9c9f83efd60eab"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," a creature, you always have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Favorable Circumstances"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Favorable_Circumstances"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Widowed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Widowed","referenceId":"reference:0e3434cbbbdcd024"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 20"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_20"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," checks, but it takes 20 times as long as normal to gain the information.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Occupations"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you choose an Occupation Background, you select an element of your character's history that defines his or her skills and abilities. Most heroes in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebellion Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebellion_Era"}," had some kind of job or career before they joined the fight against the Empire.  \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you select an Occupation Background, add one of the relevant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," listed at the end of that entry to your list of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class_Skills","referenceId":"reference:eab4e467351b3882"},", regardless of your starting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},". Your chosen ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," represents something your character learned to do as a result of his or her Occupation. Additionally, you gain a +2 competence bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"}," skill checks with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," in your Occupation's list of relevant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},".  \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OCCUPATION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RELEVANT SKILLS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Academic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Academic","referenceId":"reference:20a41b5bec99f604"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge","referenceId":"reference:dcb3e1c00e79236d"},