wse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have a strong background in technology; either you studied how to operate or repair it, or you researched new technological advancements.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Planets of Origin"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Choosing a Planet of Origin as a Background is different from choosing an Event or an Occupation. When you choose a Planet of Origin, you are declaring that your hero was raised on a world that is not typically considered to be the homeworld for their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},". For example, they might be a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rodian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rodian","referenceId":"reference:26980c5af3a71c5b"}," raised on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"},", or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothan","referenceId":"reference:d0c2f0ae1f6a1f5d"}," raised on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bespin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bespin","referenceId":"reference:9fbf56e3fbef483c"},". As a result, your hero is unlike other members of his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},". You should develop a story to explain why your hero was raised on the chosen planet. You cannot select the same Planet of Origin as the traditional homeworld of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"}," and other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," that do not have a single homeworld can choose any planet described below.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you select a Planet of Origin Background, add two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," from the relevant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," listed at the end of that entry to your character's list of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class_Skills","referenceId":"reference:eab4e467351b3882"},", regardless of starting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},". These ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," represents something your character learned on his or her planet of origin. Additionally, you add the Bonus Language given at the end of the planet's entry to your character's known ",{"tag":"a","children":["Languages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Languages","referenceId":"reference:318655cea4bd2096"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["PLANET OF ORIGIN\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RELEVANT SKILLS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BONUS LANGUAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Alderaan Origin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Alderaan_Origin","referenceId":"reference:9b928d2cd6477332"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge","referenceId":"reference:dcb3e1c00e79236d"}," (Any), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},", ",{"tag":"a","c